    <Literal ID="AB9E8B528BE05CF6959BF571963739B5">
      <Value>MSFS2024-FDR - rejestrator lotow Delphi VCL. Pierwotnie oparty na projekcie Qt, od tego czasu znaczaco przebudowany i rozbudowany.</Value>
      <Translation Locale="pl-PL">MSFS2024-FDR - rejestrator lotow Delphi VCL. Pierwotnie oparty na projekcie Qt, od tego czasu znaczaco przebudowany i rozbudowany.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="en-US">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="de-DE">MSFS2024-FDR - Flugrekorder mit Delphi VCL. Ursprünglich auf dem Qt-Projekt basierend, seitdem umfassend überarbeitet und erweitert.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="es-ES">MSFS2024-FDR - grabador de vuelos Delphi VCL. Basado inicialmente en el proyecto Qt; ampliamente rediseñado y ampliado desde entonces.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="fr-FR">MSFS2024-FDR - Enregistreur de vol Delphi VCL. Initialement basé sur le projet Qt ; réécrit et développé de manière extensive depuis.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="ru-RU">MSFS2024-FDR - Записывающее устройство полетов Delphi VCL. Сначала основано на проекте Qt; значительно переработано и расширено с тех пор.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="tr-TR">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL uçuş kaydı. İlk olarak Qt projesine dayanıyordu; o zamandan beri büyük ölçüde yeniden yapılandırıldı ve genişletildi.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="it-IT">MSFS2024-FDR - Recorder di volo Delphi VCL. Inizialmente basato sul progetto Qt; ristrutturato e ampliato in modo estensivo da allora.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="pt-PT">MSFS2024-FDR - Registador de Voo Delphi VCL. Inicialmente baseado no projeto Qt; ampliado e reestruturado extensivamente desde então.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="en-GB">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="fr-CA">MSFS2024-FDR - Enregistreur de vol Delphi VCL. Initialement basé sur le projet Qt ; réécrit et développé de manière extensive depuis.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="pt-BR">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL gravador de voo. Originalmente baseado no projeto Qt; amplamente reestruturado e expandido desde então.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="de-AT">MSFS2024-FDR - Flugrekorder mit Delphi VCL. Ursprünglich auf dem Qt-Projekt basierend, seitdem umfassend überarbeitet und erweitert.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="de-CH">MSFS2024-FDR - Flugrekorder mit Delphi VCL. Ursprünglich auf dem Qt-Projekt basierend, seitdem umfassend überarbeitet und erweitert.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="be-BY">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="el-GR">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="uk-UA">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="hr-HR">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="cs-CZ">MSFS202, FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="da-DK">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Initially based on the Qt project; extensively rebuilt and expanded since then.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="nl-NL">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL vliegtuiglogboek. Oorspronkelijk gebaseerd op het Qt-project; uitgebreid herwerk en uitgebreid sindsdien.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="fi-FI">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL lentorekisteri. Alun perin perustettu Qt-projektiin; laajasti uudistettu ja laajennettu sitten.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="nb-NO">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flyttidregister. Opprinnelig basert på Qt-prosjektet; mye ombygget og utvidet siden da.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="sk-SK">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL letiský záznamník. Pôvodne založený na projekte Qt; výrazne prepracovaný a rozšírený od tých časov.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="sv-SE">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flygdatainsamlare. Ursprungligen baserad på Qt-projektet; ombyggd och utökad sedan dess.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="zh-CN">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL 飞行记录器。最初基于 Qt 项目；此后进行了大量重建和扩展。</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="ja-JP">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL 飛行記録装置。当初は Qt プロジェクトに基づいていましたが、その後大幅に再構築・拡張されました。</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="vi-VN">MSFS2024-FDR - Máy ghi dữ liệu chuyến bay Delphi VCL. Ban đầu dựa trên dự án Qt; sau đó được xây dựng lại và mở rộng rất nhiều.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="hi-IN">MSFS2024-FDR - डेल्फी वीसीएल उड़ान रिकॉर्डर। आरंभिक रूप से Qt परियोजना पर आधारित था; इसके बाद बहुत सारा विस्तार और पुनर्निर्माण किया गया।</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="ar-SA">MSFS2024-FDR - مسجل رحلات Delphi VCL. تم بناؤه أولاً بناءً على مشروع Qt، ثم تم إعادة بناؤه وتوسيعه بشكل كبير.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="he-IL">MSFS2024-FDR - מצלם טיסה Delphi VCL. נבנה בתחילה על פרויקט Qt, אך נבנה מחדש ופואר לאחר מכן.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="id-ID">MSFS2024-FDR - Delphi VCL flight recorder. Awalnya berbasis proyek Qt; secara luas direkonstruksi dan diperluas sejak itu.</Translation>
    </Literal>
    <Literal ID="D556EEAF79EAFD3368E020F4BFACA964">
      <Value>Shift + klik: nowy raport po polsku</Value>
