    <Literal ID="4B0E0DCDBD79112ACF188EE77BC591DA">
      <Value>Pobierz ostatni plan lub otworz plan nagrania. OFP Layout domyslnie LIDO.</Value>
      <Translation Locale="pl-PL">Pobierz ostatni plan lub otworz plan nagrania. OFP Layout domyslnie LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="en-US">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="de-DE">Rufen Sie den neuesten Plan ab oder öffnen Sie den aufgezeichneten Plan. OFP-Standardlayout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="es-ES">Obtenga el último plan o abra el plan de la grabación. Formato OFP predeterminado: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="fr-FR">Récupérer le dernier plan ou ouvrir le plan enregistré. Mise en page OFP par défaut : LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="ru-RU">Загрузить последний план или открыть записанный план. Стандартная макет OFP: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="tr-TR">En son planı alın veya kaydedilen planı açın. Varsayılan OFP düzeni: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="it-IT">Ritira l'ultimo piano o apri il piano registrato. Layout OFP predefinito: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="pt-PT">Obter o último plano ou abrir o plano gravado. Layout OFP padrão: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="en-GB">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="fr-CA">Récupérer le dernier plan ou ouvrir le plan enregistré. Mise en page OFP par défaut : LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="pt-BR">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="de-AT">Rufen Sie den neuesten Plan ab oder öffnen Sie den aufgezeichneten Plan. OFP-Standardlayout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="de-CH">Rufen Sie den neuesten Plan ab oder öffnen Sie den aufgezeichneten Plan. OFP-Standardlayout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="be-BY">Паказаць апошні план або адкрыць зафіксаваны план. Зададзены выгляд OFP: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="el-GR">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="uk-UA">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="hr-HR">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="cs-CZ">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="da-DK">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="nl-NL">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="fi-FI">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="nb-NO">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="sk-SK">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="sv-SE">Fetch the latest plan or open the recorded plan. Default OFP layout: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="zh-CN">获取最新计划或打开记录的计划。默认OFP布局: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="ja-JP">最新の計画を取得するか、記録された計画を開く。デフォルトのOFPレイアウト:LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="vi-VN">Tải kế hoạch mới nhất hoặc mở kế hoạch đã ghi lại. Giao diện mặc định OFP: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="hi-IN">सबसे नवीन योजना खोजें या रिकॉर्ड की योजना खोलें। डिफ़ॉल्ट OFP लेआउट: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="ar-SA">الحصول على آخر خطة أو فتح الخطة المسجلة. تخطيط OFP الافتراضي: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="he-IL">הורדת התוכנית האחרונה או פתיחת התוכנית השמורה. תבנית OFP כברירת מחדל: LIDO.</Translation>
      <Translation Locale="id-ID">Mengambil rencana terbaru atau membuka rencana yang direkam. Tata letak OFP default: LIDO.</Translation>
    </Literal>
